  "title": "GitLab CI: Update macOS installer to Qt 6.8.3",
  "description": "Since the official macOS package libraries are targeting macOS 12\nas a development target, let's move to Qt 6.8 (like the Windows\npackage) which has a minimum deployment target of macOS 12 as well.\nQt 6.5.3 is long unsupported at this point.\n\nThis is necessary for #19328 and also should resolve #20323 according\nto the Qt bug tracker.",
